  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the answer key for the Junior Commercial Executive, Junior Assistant &amp; Assistant Manager Post. This <span class=\"google-anno-t\">recruitment</span> was released for 148 posts. Applications for CCI Various Post <span class=\"google-anno-t\">Recruitment</span> 2026 were accepted from 09 July 2024 to 24 July 2024. The written examination was held on 01 September 2026. Candidates who&nbsp;appeared for this examination can download their CCI Various Post Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Cotton Corporation of India Limited (CCIL)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Cotton Corporation CCI Various Post Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>09 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>24 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>24 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>01 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>19 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>21 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>03 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC :<strong> Rs. 1700/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH :<strong> Rs. 590/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CCI Various Post Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 09 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum. Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years (Other Post)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum. Age :&nbsp;<strong>32 Years (Assistant Manager)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per CCI Various Post Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CCI Various Post 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 148 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Management Trainee (Marketing)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Management Trainee (Accounts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">08</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Commercial Executive</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">50</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Assistant (General)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">30</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Assistant (Accounts)<strong><br>\n</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">50</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Manager (Official Language)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Manager (Information Technology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>CCI Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Management Trainee (Marketing)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span dir=\"ltr\">MBA</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">in</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">Agri</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Business</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Management/</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Agriculture</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;related MBA.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Management Trainee (Accounts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chartered Accountant CA / CMA</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Commercial Executive</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Sc Agriculture from any recognized University with an aggregate of 50% marks, 45% marks in case of SC/ST/PwBD candidates.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Assistant (General)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Any Graduate from any recognized University with an aggregate of 50% marks, 45% marks in case of SC/ST/PwBD candidates. </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Assistant (Accounts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span dir=\"ltr\">B.Com</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">from</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">any</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;recognized</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">University</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;with</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">an</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">aggregate</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">of</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;50% marks, 45% marks</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;in</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">case</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">of</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\">SC/ST/PH</span><span dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;candidates.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Manager (Official Language)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post graduate degree in Hindi with minimum 50% marks in aggregate. Should have studied English language upto graduation and should be well conversant in Hindi. Qualification in Hindi translation would be added advantage. Should be well conversant with the Government of India instructions in the matter of Hindi as official language in PSU/ Central Govt Offices. MBA will be an added advantage.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Should have minimum of 1 year experience in any organization of repute.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Manager (Information Technology)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.E. (Bachelor of Engineering) in Information Technology / Computer Science or an equivalent discipline.&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Tech (Bachelor of Technology) in Information Technology / Computer Science or an equivalent discipline.&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">MCA (Master of Computer Applications).&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download CCI Various Post Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their CCI Various Post Answer Key candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their CCI Various Post Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their CCI Various Post Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also check their CCI Various Post Answer Key from official site of the CCI.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CCI Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L